/* 3 ways of :- inline, internal,and exrernal css.
 */
 css 5 types of selectors:- 1. element/tag selector, 2. id selector, 3. class selector, 4. group selector, 5. universal selector.

 id selector starts with #
 class selector starts with .


h2 background color=red text-align:center;

h2 id="welcome"  background color=green

Here the h2[id] will also take text-aligin, it overwrite the h2 bg color by unquie identiification, h2->bg,text-align->h2[id]-oveerwrites bg color 
